From 99cc3d27fe4451e5e5bfaf758eb8d417c88aef5e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wmehanna <wassimmehanna@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:43:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(vmapple): build apple-gfx-mmio on reims-vgpu for TCG
 hosts

The apple-gfx device model is built against reims-vgpu (--enable-pvg)
instead of Apple's ParavirtualizedGraphics framework, so a non-Apple
host can provide the paravirtual GPU. Adapts the device to this host
(no KVM dirty source, wheel input, trace events) and includes the
device config so create_gfx sees MAC_PVG_MMIO.
